    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεκ-κομίξω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry out</i> or <i>away to safety,</i>
